  "description": "When the unemployed Seol-Won unexpectedly finds himself responsible for managing his parents’ boarding home during their impromptu countryside retreat, he’s taken aback, to say the least. As five tenants, each with distinctive and unexpected personalities, take up residence, Won is about to embark on a journey filled with trials, tribulations, and a delightful dose of shenanigans beyond anything he could have anticipated!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
